---
source: crates/monochange_publish/src/__tests__/lib_tests.rs
expression: "scope_message(&release_event[1])"
---
pub.dev only accepts dart_pkg 1.0.0 from a run that a `push` or `workflow_dispatch` event starts, and a `release` event started this run on `refs/tags/dart_pkg/v1.0.0`. No `release` run ever publishes it, so start the publish workflow from tag pushes (`on: push`) instead of `on: release`. To publish this version now, run `gh workflow run publish.yml --repo owner/repo --ref dart_pkg/v1.0.0`
